      "quote": "Conventionally, these surgeries are planned using 2-dimensional (2D) imaging modalities, such as computed tomography (CT) and X-ray imaging [10]. * Zubair Ahmed z.ahmed.1@bham.ac.uk ... Such 2D renderings, however, fail to accurately depict the structural complexities of bony fractures, which may lead to imperfect reconstruction.",
